  "releaseNotes": "## Changes since 5.6.0\n* Improved performance of IEnumerable ``Remove`` extension methods\n* Improved performance of an IDictionary ``AddRange`` extension method\n* Removed deprecated code\n* Added explicit .NET 9 TFM\n* Removed string indexing extension methods\n* Removed dependency on SystemExtensions\n* Adjusted namespaces\n* Added IDictionary ``GetValueOrDefault<TKey, TValue>(this IDictionary dictionary, TKey key, TValue defaultValue)`` extension method\n* Renamed IEnumerable ``GetKey`` method to ``GetKeyByValue`` and ``GetKeys`` to ``GetKeysByValue``",
